00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.620
In our front-end
service here we have--

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.600
it's a package JSON.

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.120
It's a idiomatic Node.js app.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.370
We have a handful of
