00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:59.420
that's in /stylesheets and
/scripts and /.* are going

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:02.112
to be cached by a
CDN at the edge.

00:17:02.112 --> 00:17:03.820
We know that all those
assets are static,

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:06.790
so by creating these
handlers, App Engine smartly

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.310
knows how to cache that.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:11.890
And then we have app.js
here, which is the main entry

00:17:11.890 --> 00:17:14.030
point into our application.

